- Purpose of this specific status conference: what will the judge expect (scheduling only, settlement/mediation discussion, threshold issues, temporary/ emergency relief)?
- Proposed schedule: deadlines the court will likely set (discovery cutoff, dispositive motions, exchange of financial disclosures, witness lists, pretrial conference, trial date).
- What filings are required before the status conference (case management statement, proposed schedule, parenting plan, financial affidavit, proof of service)?
