  - Should I communicate directly with the other parent/landlord, or let you handle communications?
  - What settlement terms would be acceptable to me, and which are deal-breakers?

- Court logistics & preparation
  - What should I bring to the status conference (copies of documents, witnesses, declarations)?
  - How should I testify if asked — what should I say and avoid?
  - How long will the hearing likely take and who will appear?

